                    {
                        "sense_id": "ab69d291-67f6-3b21-ae7f-1f738268b94b",
                        "entry_id": "2648e9ec-e4dd-3bde-83a3-237e0d12b413",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Bewohner von Basel, jemand, der aus Basel stammt"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "04705163-467e-4e8f-8229-67078153458f",
                                "sense_id": "ab69d291-67f6-3b21-ae7f-1f738268b94b",
                                "text": "Mein Wohnungsnachbar ist ein gebürtiger Basler."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2ae0106a-0486-4bfc-8c4e-c7818a004d00",
                        "source_entry_id": "2648e9ec-e4dd-3bde-83a3-237e0d12b413",
                        "source_sense_id": "ab69d291-67f6-3b21-ae7f-1f738268b94b",
                        "source_sense_description": "Bewohner von Basel, jemand, der aus Basel stammt",
                        "target_lang_word": "Basler",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Basler",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5ce06675-bfef-376b-be61-2f070172a162",
                                        "entry_id": "365a8f33-d936-33e0-9e24-a77a8a1eb622",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A surname from German of German origin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Basler",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "365403d4-7ccf-3b46-b0ed-bf1f8af0f81a",
                                        "entry_id": "e72a40e3-e984-3193-b520-f02ba7e0211e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone from Basel, Switzerland."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b63a0a44-78ce-437a-a5bc-fa2ec5714e1c",
                                                "sense_id": "365403d4-7ccf-3b46-b0ed-bf1f8af0f81a",
                                                "text": "For the Baslers no town exists but their own: only Basel is \"civilized,\" and north of the river Birs the land of the barbarians begins."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "490a3ed0-9130-4b1a-92f8-c7051f336873",
                                                "sense_id": "365403d4-7ccf-3b46-b0ed-bf1f8af0f81a",
                                                "text": "Central to this is the understanding that Burckhardt was first and foremost a Basler."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4186330a-e17e-4c43-a39d-b2dbac6ba055",
                                                "sense_id": "365403d4-7ccf-3b46-b0ed-bf1f8af0f81a",
                                                "text": "Although the bishop was nonresident, his officials and administrators still lived in Basel and staffed the episcopal courts. Their presence, in turn, provided employment for many Baslers and made the area around the chapel a community in itself."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0e4714fa-4ddf-4ae6-ac05-c4fcf51227ae",
                                                "sense_id": "365403d4-7ccf-3b46-b0ed-bf1f8af0f81a",
                                                "text": "Baslers consider their Fasnacht the \"drey scheenschte Dääg,\" or the \"three most beautiful days\" of the year."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "20929910-2cbb-498b-8320-7f7341e52902",
                        "source_entry_id": "2648e9ec-e4dd-3bde-83a3-237e0d12b413",
                        "source_sense_id": "ab69d291-67f6-3b21-ae7f-1f738268b94b",
                        "source_sense_description": "Bewohner von Basel, jemand, der aus Basel stammt",
                        "target_lang_word": "Bâlois",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Bâlois",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "17af8ac4-04a7-3b32-8b42-60e91da6f59c",
                                        "entry_id": "f331b341-352e-3086-9e00-7f6e5ca3b12b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Habitant de Bâle en Suisse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a84c1a5c-fd39-425e-9a35-876f1736e87c",
                                                "sense_id": "17af8ac4-04a7-3b32-8b42-60e91da6f59c",
                                                "text": "Plus essentielle encore pour le Bâlois - devenu décidément ecclésiophile, mais non papistophile — l’immense basilique de Saint-Sernin, modèle d’une architecture romane et méridionale."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "619e4c1a-001d-4022-9d94-05cbd98d9cc0",
                                                "sense_id": "17af8ac4-04a7-3b32-8b42-60e91da6f59c",
                                                "text": "Roland 2008, on s’en souvient, le Bâlois n’avait pas tenu deux heures contre Rafael Nadal."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c68b1b03-99b7-445c-8c50-6e717b714e52",
                                                "sense_id": "17af8ac4-04a7-3b32-8b42-60e91da6f59c",
                                                "text": "L’épéiste chaux-de-fonnière Pauline Brunner et le Bâlois Benjamin Steffen se sont qualifiés pour le tableau principal (64 concurrentes) des Championnats du monde de Kazan (Rus)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7827f378-7e6e-41fc-93a1-24aa06a6857f",
                        "source_entry_id": "2648e9ec-e4dd-3bde-83a3-237e0d12b413",
                        "source_sense_id": "ab69d291-67f6-3b21-ae7f-1f738268b94b",
